          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "Audio exists in the code but not in this checkpoint",
      "text": "Gemma4AudioModel and a third masked_scatter branch are present in modeling_gemma4.py, but the 31B-it config has audio_config = null, so the tower is never built. Worth knowing before you go looking for an audio path that is not loaded.",
